//　言うなれば光の父は、社会秩序に奪われた。
//　光が父を欲して世界の破壊者たるのなら――確かに
//それは狂気ではなく、道理なのかもしれない。
  So in a sense, it was society<br>―civilization itself―that took Hikaru's father from her. If this quest to destroy "the world of man" is meant to bring her father back, then perhaps she is driven by reason, not insanity after all.

